  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bamboo Good Rolls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social and sustainable toilet paper is what the Good Rolls focuses on. Already producing 100% recycled paper based toilet rolls at the moment, the Good Roll has now developed bamboo based toilet rolls that are being produced in Ghana. Socially the company invests 50% of its profits in building lavatories in Ghana. DGGF-TA financed a pilot project and feasibility study on the production of the bamboo toilet paper in Ghana. Outcome of the project is that the Good Roll will build a factory in where they can produce their paper from 100% Ghanaian bamboo. During the project, 4 people have been employed locally to do research. 20 indirect jobs have been supported related to the production of the product.</narrative>
  </description>
